On the same 64-core AMD EPYC with 2 threads per core:

   #Cores  Input size  Time(s)  BW/core(MB/s)   Total BW(MB/s)
       1  2*211947520   0.549       771.6            771.6
       2  2*211947520   0.541       783.6           1567.1
       3  2*211947520   0.546       775.9           2327.8
